type: api
title: Bearer auth with env token
description: |-
  Calls a bearer-protected endpoint using the token pulled from Vault
  (or the mock) via `setenv` → `e:api_token`.

  Default URL hits the local mock. Swap to
  `https://test.mmt.dev/auth/bearer` to verify against the public sandbox
  (expects `Bearer testtoken`).
protocol: http
method: get
url: <<e:vault_addr>>/auth/bearer
format: json
auth:
  type: bearer
  token: e:api_token
